[en.FOCUS_C11_BUGBEAR_CONTROLLED]
Bugbears Managed

[en.FOCUS_C11_BUGBEAR_CONTROLLED_desc]
The Changeling troops sent to Drungar successfully managed the restless Bugbears, allowing us to take substantial control of this territory.

[zh.FOCUS_C11_BUGBEAR_CONTROLLED]
治理蜂熊

[zh.FOCUS_C11_BUGBEAR_CONTROLLED_desc]
幻形灵帝国向德伦加尔派出的军队成功治理了躁动的蜂熊族群，我们得以趁机实质控制了这片领地。

